learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:14: trailing whitespace.
+  <main>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:15: trailing whitespace.
+    <p class="banner" id="training-banner">Training rehearsal - synthetic data - not a live Azure result</p>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:16: trailing whitespace.
+    <h1>S120: No viable destination</h1>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:17: trailing whitespace.
+    <p>A-S120 · D-S120 · SC-S120 · one portable learning unit, not native proof.</p>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:18: trailing whitespace.
+    <p>Remove both fixed fictional paths. A correct educational negative verdict must still say
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:19: trailing whitespace.
+      <strong>interrupted users</strong>, never zero-downtime migration success.</p>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:20: trailing whitespace.
+    <section aria-labelledby="scope-title">
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:21: trailing whitespace.
+      <h2 id="scope-title">Fixed teaching envelope</h2>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:22: trailing whitespace.
+      <p>All regions, reachability, capacity, state, requests, effects, durations and outcomes below are
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:23: trailing whitespace.
+        synthetic data only. Buttons change this page's in-memory data, not resources, processes or networks.</p>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:24: trailing whitespace.
+      <p>Demand: 2 units. Each path: capacity 2, shared authoritative state revision 7, writer epoch 3.
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:25: trailing whitespace.
+        At least one reachable compatible path is required. The fixed 100 ms budget is illustrative, not an Azure limit.</p>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:26: trailing whitespace.
+      <ol>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:27: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Observe a supported control, remove origin-a, and observe the surviving origin-b.</li>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:28: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Remove origin-b too; observe two interrupted requests and one unknown in-flight write.</li>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:29: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Check the expected-interruption verdict; try the incorrect zero-downtime claim and blind retry.</li>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:30: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Reconcile the fixed authoritative snapshot and recover only an owned fictional path.
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:31: trailing whitespace.
+          Earlier interruptions and uncertainty must remain.</li>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:32: trailing whitespace.
+        <li>Reset to archive this run, then rehearse again. Five archives and twelve accepted actions per run are the limits.</li>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:33: trailing whitespace.
+      </ol>
learning/S120/evidence/red/index-html.source:34: trailing whitespace.
+    </section>
